# Vertical Processes for Report Output Control Screen (XMC0)
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# History
# ~~~~~~~
# 06/05/2016    Tim Wilcox      V03.05.00   T----   original release
# 12/04/2017    Tim Wilcox      V03.05.01   T----   all functions moved to XMOXM5MC
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Version Control
# ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Funprog VERTEST() : End "03.05.01 12/04/2017 XM5"
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

################################################################################
## Main Process
## ~~~~~~~~~~~~
##
##  Called for each ACTION.
##  In here we call additional processing for specific ACTION codes.
##
################################################################################
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ACTION

    If func AFNC.ACTIV("XM5")
        Gosub ACTION From XMOXM5MC
    Endif

Return

